e_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GymZeYBNKb1R3UD6mbjZwR", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13998, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GymZeYBNKb1R3UD6mbjZwR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17015, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018gfchzmsRAPqAS8NtM9egW", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 17315, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018gfchzmsRAPqAS8NtM9egW", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17315, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018gfchzmsRAPqAS8NtM9egW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21874, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GBcbxPhst3B1rFFGHgLyBE", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of checkout-api v2.3.1 to production, the service started failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. Release v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging. checkout-api was rolled back in all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before trying to deploy it again.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 59974, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GBcbxPhst3B1rFFGHgLyBE", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59974, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GBcbxPhst3B1rFFGHgLyBE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63849, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the service is healthy again. I also opened incident INC-0001 (SEV2), which paged on-call.\n\n- **Version chosen:** The bad deploy was v2.3.1, with an error rate of about 18%. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Rollback:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all running v2.3.0 now. I checked afterwards: the service shows as healthy and the error rate has dropped to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The summary covers the failure, the rollback and the fact that v2.3.1 shouldn't be deployed again until someone finds what broke it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01V5vFQnCE4RGp8xn9B91Pic", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SThu7Kc36JWFqSoFNkouMf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content":